; Tune step counter: also the animation phase of the lives display
;
; Incremented once per pass by #R$8B07 ($8B44) while the tune is on (bit 1 of
; #R$85E2 clear); it keeps its value while the tune is off. Bits 1-6 select the
; note of the game tune (#R$865F: note = (counter AND $7E) / 2, so a note lasts
; two passes and the 64 notes repeat every 128 passes) and bits 2-3 select the
; Willy frame shown by the lives display (#R$898B). Cleared by #R$87CA.
@label=TuneStep
g$85E1 DEFB $00
